@startuml
' Figure 1: IntentStrategy Auto 模式主流程
!pragma teoz true
title Figure 1: IntentStrategy — Auto 模式主流程
skinparam backgroundColor #fefefe
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

actor User

box "dify_host [System]" #LightBlue
    box "plugin_runtime [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant AgentInvoker as "AgentInvoker"
    end box
    box "llm_session [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant LLMSession as "LLMSession"
    end box
    box "file_session [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant FileSession as "FileSession"
    end box
    box "file_storage [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant FileStorage as "FileStorage"
    end box
end box

box "intent_agent_plugin [System]" #LightBlue
    box "strategy [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant IntentStrategy as "IntentStrategy"
    end box
    box "prompts [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant PromptLoader as "PromptLoader"
    end box
    box "tool_registry [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant ToolRegistry as "ToolRegistry"
    end box
end box

box "n8n [System]" #LightBlue
    box "webhook [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant N8nWebhook as "N8nWebhook"
    end box
end box

participant ExternalHTTP as "ExternalHTTP"

== Invoke ==

User -> AgentInvoker: 送出 query\n(image_files, audio_files, execution_mode=auto)
activate AgentInvoker
AgentInvoker -> IntentStrategy: _invoke(parameters)
activate IntentStrategy

note over IntentStrategy
  **Step 1. _parse_history**
  將 model.history_prompt_messages
  轉為 SystemPromptMessage /
  UserPromptMessage /
  AssistantPromptMessage 列表
end note

note over IntentStrategy
  **Step 2. _detect_mode_override**
  掃描 query 關鍵字：
  「自動執行 / 不用確認」→ auto
  「逐步確認 / 我要確認每一步」→ step-by-step
  此圖前提：**mode = auto（無覆寫）**
end note

note over IntentStrategy
  **Step 3. _detect_pending_state**
  反向掃 history 最近一則 assistant，
  找 <pending_state>...</pending_state> JSON
  此圖前提：**未偵測到 pending_state**
end note

== Step 4. 載入 system prompt ==

IntentStrategy -> PromptLoader: load()
activate PromptLoader
PromptLoader --> IntentStrategy: system_prompt (prompts/prompt.md)
deactivate PromptLoader

== Step 5. 組 user message（多模態）==

note over IntentStrategy
  **_build_user_message**
  - 正規化 image_files / audio_files (Dify File 物件)
  - 從 query 文字抽出 [IMAGE_URL_N]...[/IMAGE_URL_N]
  - 無外部互動的檔案直接轉成 PromptMessageContent
end note

opt query 含 [IMAGE_URL_N]...[/IMAGE_URL_N] 標籤
    IntentStrategy -> ExternalHTTP: GET image url
    activate ExternalHTTP
    ExternalHTTP --> IntentStrategy: image bytes → base64
    deactivate ExternalHTTP
end

note over IntentStrategy
  **組 messages**
  messages = [
    SystemPromptMessage(system_prompt),
    *history_messages,
    UserPromptMessage(user_message)
  ]
end note

== Step 6. Agent Loop ==

loop maximum_iterations
    IntentStrategy -> LLMSession: invoke(messages, tool_schemas, stream=True)
    activate LLMSession
    LLMSession --> IntentStrategy: response_text + tool_calls
    deactivate LLMSession

    alt 有 tool_calls
        loop 每個 tool_call
            IntentStrategy -> ToolRegistry: build_payload(name, args)
            activate ToolRegistry
            ToolRegistry --> IntentStrategy: payload
            deactivate ToolRegistry

            IntentStrategy -> ToolRegistry: call_n8n_with_retry(name, payload)
            activate ToolRegistry
            note right of ToolRegistry: 含 3 次重試\n指數退避
            ToolRegistry -> N8nWebhook: POST /webhook/{uuid}
            activate N8nWebhook
            N8nWebhook --> ToolRegistry: response (text 或 image/*)
            deactivate N8nWebhook
            ToolRegistry --> IntentStrategy: (text, raw_bytes, meta)
            deactivate ToolRegistry

            alt raw_bytes != None  (n8n 回傳圖片)
                IntentStrategy -> FileSession: _backwards_invoke(UploadFile)
                activate FileSession
                FileSession --> IntentStrategy: signed_url
                deactivate FileSession

                IntentStrategy -> FileStorage: POST signed_url (multipart)
                activate FileStorage
                FileStorage --> IntentStrategy: preview_url
                deactivate FileStorage

                IntentStrategy --> AgentInvoker: yield image_message(preview_url)
                AgentInvoker --> User: 顯示圖片
            end
        end
    else 無 tool_calls 但 runtime_state.queue 有 pending
        note right of IntentStrategy: **queue_forced_tool_call**\n強制執行下一個 pending item\n無需等待 LLM 產生
    else 無 tool_calls 且無 pending
        break
    end
end

alt runtime_state.queue 全部完成
    note over IntentStrategy
        **final_status = "completed"**
        所有 queue 項目 done/cancelled/failed
    end note
else runtime_state.queue 有未完成項目
    note over IntentStrategy
        **final_status = "unfinished_queue"**
        附加 <pending_state> 標籤
        待下一輪用戶確認或補充
    end note
end

== Response ==

IntentStrategy --> AgentInvoker: yield text_message(response_text)
deactivate IntentStrategy
AgentInvoker --> User: 顯示最終文字回覆
deactivate AgentInvoker

@enduml
